      "content": "I'm looking at a parcel in Austin where the client wants to reclassify from R-1 to mixed-use. We've hit a snag with some conflicting language in the local code regarding setback requirements and how they interact with existing minor encroachments from a neighboring property's fence line. Can you outline a strategy for approaching the zoning board to resolve these conflicting clauses?",
